[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0020","text":"小糸的话一定没问题的\n我会好好，在这里看着你的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0030","text":"────好、好的……！\n………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0040","text":"我、我……\n为了今天，该做的都、都做了……我想"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0050","text":"所以……所以……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0060","text":"接下来，就只需要让小糸展现全力了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0070","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0080","text":"是的……\n对、对啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0090","text":"小糸能享受其中，我也会很高兴的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0100","text":"好、好的……！\n那、那我出发了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200300_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
